# Boards this example is built and gated for.
#
# rt1062 is here for regression coverage, not because a bug is outstanding:
# EVKB_BOARD=rt1062 links cores/teensy4, which carries its OWN WString.cpp and
# nonstd.c. Those get COMPILED by other rt1062 builds (serial_test links them
# too -- WString.cpp alone defines 102 symbols in that libcores.o.a), but until
# now nothing ASSERTED their behaviour on this core: compiled is not tested. The
# two implementations agree today (both use the lowercase 0123456789abcdef...
# digit table, so String(255, HEX) is "ff" on both) -- this gate is what keeps
# them agreeing now that teensy4 is compiled rather than reference-only.
rt1176
rt1062
